	(text "J2 rev 2.1: Phoenix PT 1,5/13-3,5-H, one 13-way 3.5 mm block. Rev 2.0's J3 (X1202 feed) folded in; OBD pin 5 (signal ground) dropped.\n1 +12V_RAW (OBD 16, 18 AWG)  2 GND chassis (OBD 4, 18 AWG)  3 +12V out to X1202 (18 AWG)  4 GND out to X1202 (18 AWG)\n5 CANH (OBD 6)  6 CANL (OBD 14)  7 KLINE (OBD 7)  8 SENS_GND (TMAP return; buffers the K-line from the analog pins)\n9 SENS_V1  10 SENS_R1  11 5V_SENS  12 FUEL_GND (AEM BROWN = analog minus -> AIN_4GND, NOT a ground)  13 FUEL_P (AEM WHITE)\nOther wires 20 AWG. Ferrule on every wire (collared, <= 0.75 mm2). A rev 2.0 harness does NOT fit this order."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 167.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
