		(property "Description" "Phoenix Contact PT 1,5/13-3,5-H, 13-position 3.5 mm screw terminal block (screw connection with wire protector)"
			(at 91.44 86.36 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Note" "Vehicle + sensor harness, one 13-way block (rev 2.1 folds rev 2.0's J3 in and drops OBD pin 5). 1 +12V_RAW (OBD 16, 18 AWG) 2 GND chassis (OBD 4, 18 AWG) 3 +12V protected out to X1202 (18 AWG) 4 GND out to X1202 (18 AWG) 5 CANH 6 CANL 7 KLINE 8 SENS_GND 9 SENS_V1 10 SENS_R1 11 5V_SENS 12 FUEL_GND (AEM BROWN, analog minus) 13 FUEL_P (AEM WHITE). FERRULE ON EVERY WIRE: this family takes ferrules with plastic sleeve 0.25-0.75 mm2, so the four 18 AWG power wires (pins 1-4) use 0.75 mm2 collared ferrules (Phoenix AI 0,75, rated AWG 18) and 20 AWG a 0.5 mm2. The MKDS 1 / SMKDS 1 3.5 mm families were rejected: 0.5 mm2 ferrule maximum. A rev 2.0 harness does NOT fit this pin order."
			(at 55.88 -43.18 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(justify left)
			)
		)
		(property "Manufacturer" "Phoenix Contact"
			(at 91.44 74.93 0)
			(hide yes)
