		(property "Quote" "Rev 2.1: not yet quoted. Phoenix order number 1984727 = PT 1,5/13-3,5-H (Phoenix catalogue; the 12-way is 1984714, the 14-way 1984730). Side-latching family: a 10-way + 3-way latched together has the same pitch and footprint if the 13-way is not stocked."
